# Elspeth's loyalty abilities: one per turn per planeswalker (CR 606.3), so after the +1 on turn 1 the 0 is refused. Her
# 0 touches only creatures she controls: Bot2's Tireless Tracker (a 3/2) gets no counter and no flying on turn 3. Her -3
# targets "a creature an opponent controls with mana value 3 or greater" (CR 115.1, 202.3): on turn 5 Bot2's Elvish
# Mystic (value 1) and her own Soldier token are refused, the Tracker (value 3) is the control and is destroyed.

